------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Independent reimplementations and prior-art references
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The HAT spatial backbone (oss/sr/v6/hat.py) is an independent reimplementation
of Chen et al., "Activating More Pixels in Image Super-Resolution Transformer"
(CVPR 2023). The original reference implementation is Apache-2.0 licensed.
No code is copied verbatim from the upstream HAT repository.

Other prior-art references (GSASR, AAA-Gaussians, AA-2DGS, vk_gaussian_splatting,
GaussianVideo, 4DGS-1K, GS-STVSR, etc.) are cited in BIBLIOGRAPHY.md and
integrated as design inspiration only. No code from those projects is included
in OSS verbatim; the v6 architecture is an independent integration of the
ideas, with provenance recorded per-component in the bibliography.

